# @@title@@

A website made with Forge Web: React, Vite and TypeScript, built to static files and hosted by
Forge Web from `forge.app.toml`. It has no server of its own; when it needs accounts, data or
payments, Forge turns it into a full product.

| Path | What it is |
| --- | --- |
| `web/src/App.tsx` | the pages |
| `web/src/styles.css` | the design tokens and the layout (see `docs/DESIGN.md`) |
| `docs/DESIGN.md` | the site's look: palette, type, layout and tone |
| `forge.app.toml` | what hosting needs |

## Run it

```bash
cd web
npm ci
npm run dev      # http://localhost:5173
npm test
npm run build    # into web/dist
```
